{"type":"text","timestamp":1786601564203,"sessionID":"ses_0063fe463ffeQM2D2xyo1KhtBm","part":{"id":"prt_ff9c0641700141XwLPHdY0jcZa","messageID":"msg_ff9c050650010CbVTHAt2NsVz7","sessionID":"ses_0063fe463ffeQM2D2xyo1KhtBm","type":"text","text":"The repository only contains an unrelated Flask todo API, so I’ll replace it with a focused asyncio service. I’ll expose a reusable `NotificationServer` with a locked client registry, WebSocket handling, and `/health` on a separate HTTP listener to avoid coupling REST behavior to version-specific WebSocket handshake hooks.","time":{"start":1786601563159,"end":1786601564198},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0c2cde043dbb551a016a7d605b15ac8191a3d30c9fe6af0ed3","phase":"commentary"}}}}
